## Model License Inventory

| Model File | Size | License | Source | Compliance Risk |
|------------|------|---------|--------|-----------------|
| `zoobot_encoder_greyscale.onnx` | 57.1 MB | **GPL-3.0** | Zoobot pretrained (mwalmsley) | 🔴 HIGH — copyleft |
| `source_classifier.onnx` | 4.8 KB | MIT | Trained on synthetic data | 🟢 NONE |
| `anomaly_autoencoder.onnx` | 475.9 KB | MIT | Trained on AliCPT-1 data | 🟢 NONE |
| `morphology_archetypes.json` | ~120 KB | CC0 | Generated from DECaLS DR9 survey | 🟢 NONE |
| `source_classifier_scaler.json` | ~1 KB | MIT | Feature normalization params | 🟢 NONE |
| `anomaly_autoencoder_scaler.json` | ~1 KB | MIT | Feature normalization params | 🟢 NONE |

### Training Data Provenance

- **source_classifier.onnx**: Trained on 6,000 synthetic astronomy samples
  (star/galaxy/quasar photometric profiles). No third-party survey data used.
- **anomaly_autoencoder.onnx**: Trained on 180 AliCPT-1 FITS cutouts.
  AliCPT-1 is the project's own data. No third-party copyright concerns.
- **morphology_archetypes.json**: 640-D embeddings generated from DECaLS DR9
  survey cutouts (public domain, no copyright restriction on derived features).
- **zoobot_encoder_greyscale.onnx**: Pretrained by Mike Walmsley on Galaxy Zoo
  DECaLS (GZ-DESI) dataset. The GZ-DESI labels are CC0; the model weights
  are GPL-3.0 per the author's choice.
